    "scope": "Implemented a client-side Sentry noise filter that drops browser-extension-originated events from our Sentry monitoring. Investigation confirmed every chrome-extension:// console error is third-party-extension-originated, not app code; many lines (service-worker-loader.js, runtime.lastError, another extension's own Sentry warning) are unreachable from our SDK and cannot be filtered. The actionable in-app task wired ignoreErrors / denyUrls / beforeSend into Sentry.init via a new pure module apps/web/src/lib/sentry/extension-noise-filter.ts, keeping app's own errors fully captured (fail-open). Commit, push, and PR are user-gated.",
